---
import VideoCard from "./VideoCard.astro";
---
<section class="not-prose mx-auto max-w-5xl" aria-label="Shove task and research overview">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-5 md:grid-cols-[3fr_2fr]">
    <VideoCard src="videos/shove_task.mp4" poster="posters/shove_task.jpg" title="Shove task · 17-second simulation excerpt" aspect="16/9">
      Simulation excerpt: poor shove heights topple the object; an informed shove reaches the target region.
    </VideoCard>
    <div>
      <h2 class="m-0 text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight">Motivation</h2>
      <p class="mb-3 mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">Whether a shove slides an object or tips it over depends on its mass, center of mass, and friction. We estimate these properties without grasping, using a sliding push and a press-and-pull tipping motion.</p>
      <a class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-4 dark:text-emerald-400" href="#overview">Video overview ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
